    "title": "Moon in the Sunshine",
    "enTitle": "Moon in the Sunshine",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ある日の昼休み。\n資料を見ながら、トレーナー室で昼食をとっていると……。",
            "enText": "One day, during lunch break. While looking over some \ndocuments, I was eating lunch in the trainers' offices……",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 91,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 3290867053161215517,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Oh my!　またお仕事と一緒にlunch？\nラブラブすぎて妬けちゃうわね。",
            "enText": "Oh my! Having lunch while working again? \nSo in love with work that you're making me jealous.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 208,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あれ、こんな時間にどうしたんだ？",
                    "enText": "Huh? What's wrong now?",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "あれ、こんな時間にどうしたの？",
                    "enText": "",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -8854678575003035668
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 28,
                    "pathId": 3690801109041144464
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5309437593145150068,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ちょっと午後のトレーニングについて相談したくって。ほら、\nレースに向けて強度を上げて、時間も延ばすって話をしたでしょ？",
            "enText": "I just had some questions about this afternoon's training. \nRemember? To prep for the next race we talked about \nincreasing the intensity and duration of training, right?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 302,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 279,
                    "pathId": -4809345943601757551
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 27,
                    "pathId": 407886128858575930
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1704673114909860744,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "そしたら友だちが、自分のトレーニングを終えてから応援に来たい\nって言ってくれてね。少し騒がしくなりそうなんだけど、いい？",
            "enText": "And so my friends said that after their training was done, they wanted \nto come cheer me on. It might get a little rowdy, but is that okay?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 273,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "全然、それぐらい問題ないよ",
                    "enText": "Of course, that's fine",
                    "nextBlock": 5
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 83,
                    "pathId": -6336423871856000644
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -986881634623985728
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8063993770726231897,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "むしろ、デアリングハートは声援があると燃えるタイプだ。\n本番に近い環境になるのは、こちらとしてもありがたい。",
            "enText": "Daring Heart was the type to get fired up when surrounded by cheers. \nIt would be helpful in simulating an actual live race.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": -2381827638639867730
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4482776008690027611,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Really?　Thanks!\nじゃ、そう伝えておくわね！",
            "enText": "Really? Thanks! \nThen, I'll let them know!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 156,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 140,
                    "pathId": -8965874516918187699
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -326648644871626400
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4706500374529695713,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ふー……I'm all set!\nそろそろ始めましょうか！",
            "enText": "Phew……I'm all set. \nIt's about time we get started!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 183,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 5074882989406005942
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 6751833135812563096
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 6812127428996851343
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9102044383834062849,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人たち",
            "enName": "Heart's Friends",
            "jpText": "D・A・R・I・N・G！　ハート！\nD・A・R・I・N・G！　ハート！　フ～！",
            "enText": "D・A・R・I・N・G! Heart! \nD・A・R・I・N・G! Heart! Wooo～!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 262,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "！？",
                    "enText": "!?",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 211,
                    "pathId": -8955873816233805678
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 272,
                    "pathId": 8338317171491956268
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9145381155359233212,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "突然の応援コールに驚いて観客席を見ると、そこには\n『Daring Heart』のプラカードを掲げた一団がいた。",
            "enText": "I was startled by the sudden cheers. When I looked towards the stands, \nI saw a group of girls holding placards with 『Daring Heart』 on them.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ハ、ハート？応援ってもしかして……",
                    "enText": "H-Heart? Is this what you meant……?",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 104,
                    "pathId": 5724194521235325446
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 143,
                    "pathId": 4679015479627012427
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8173787840141099053,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Yes.\nフフッ、いい子たちでしょ？",
            "enText": "Yes. \nFufu, they're great, aren't they?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 83,
                    "pathId": -8185181753846628967
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": 4547325712662268609
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1495108894972512651,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "――Thank you for cheering for me!\nその声援、無駄にはしないわ♪",
            "enText": "――Thank you for cheering for me! \nThose cheers, I won't let them go to waste♪",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 173,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 83,
                    "pathId": -7339749118019866800
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -6007523598963465919
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1270757769969870953,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人たち",
            "enName": "Heart's Friends",
            "jpText": "ヒュ～♪",
            "enText": "Whew～♪",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 57,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "す、すごいな……",
                    "enText": "C-crazy……",
                    "nextBlock": 13
