            ],
            "pathId": 3003666523924536593,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そしてその後、デアリングハートと応援してくれたみんなで、\n一緒に夕ご飯を食べることになった――のだが。",
            "enText": "After all that, Daring Heart and all her \nfriends decided to have dinner together――however――",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 82,
                    "pathId": -2722904439265439427
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": 623695656901566833
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3996196909697937272,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Hey, buddy!\n今日は、カフェテリアじゃないわよ！",
            "enText": "Hey, buddy! \nToday, we're not going there!",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 129,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 149,
                    "pathId": 1592377356060354331
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 1984865728162606189
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3039872782827563372,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人C",
            "enName": "Heart's Friend C",
            "jpText": "――いよーし！\nレッツ、ハッピーディナーターイム☆",
            "enText": "――Alllright! \nLet's Happy Dinner Time☆",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 158,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "えっと……もしかして誰かの誕生日？",
                    "enText": "Uh……is it someone's birthday?",
                    "nextBlock": 16
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": 8953849191820246208
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 9,
                    "pathId": -2467155041359586865
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4428588585612212223,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "No way!\nそれならもっと気合い入れるわよ。",
            "enText": "No way! \nIf it was, we'd put way more effort in to it.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 132,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -7242911871983585346
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 2236309948985993988
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2057240606237433805,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ほら、全員寮が一緒ってわけじゃないでしょう？\nこれは定期的に開いている、合同ディナーってところね！",
            "enText": "Look, we're not all in the same dorm, right? \nSo this is a joint dinner we have together pretty often!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 240,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "な、なるほど……？",
                    "enText": "I-I see……?",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 63,
                    "pathId": -1424776388032879970
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 29,
                    "pathId": -1469773088576022786
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6229401628929901347,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人A",
            "enName": "Heart's Friend A",
            "jpText": "毎日寮とカフェテリアじゃ飽きちゃいますしね！\n……料理は職員さんのですけど！",
            "enText": "We get tired of using only the dorm and cafeteria everyday, you know! \n……It's the same food cooked by the staff though!",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 201,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 140,
                    "pathId": -7410187243283727321
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 232,
                    "pathId": 6528938285677232873
                }
