            "pathId": 741298545995947788,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Got it!\n……ところで。あなた、明日の予定は？",
            "enText": "Got it! ……By the way. \nDo you have any plans tomorrow?",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 195,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 4352492706886527293
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6878884444236881117,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "問われ、首をかしげる。明日は予定という予定はなく、\n自宅で資料を眺めるつもりだったが……。",
            "enText": "I tilted my head in response to the question. \nI didn't really have any specific plans other \nthan staying home and reviewing some documents but……",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "特にないけど、どうかした？",
                    "enText": "Not really, why?",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 116,
                    "pathId": -1196873005286762915
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3139389667689206989,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "実は明日、知り合いのガーデンパーティーに誘われてるのよ。\n……よかったら、あなたも一緒に来ない？",
            "enText": "You see, an acquaintance invited me to a garden party tomorrow. \n……If you'd like, how about coming with me?",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 240,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "え、俺も！？",
                    "enText": "Eh, me!?",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "え、私も！？",
                    "enText": "Eh, me!?",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 211,
                    "pathId": -2705728820352258847
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 3678322143378586495
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1073817672307224617,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Yes!　今回は『テーマパーティー』よ。\n主催が決めたテーマに沿った格好やゲームをするの。",
            "enText": "Yes! This time it's a 『Themed Party』. We'll be dressing up \nand playing games based on the theme set by the organizers.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 217,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 96,
                    "pathId": -6778163669661805854
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": -2118910047545431423
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -316195591579116937,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "今回のテーマは『スパイ』だから……\nエージェントやSPになりきるの。どうかしら？",
            "enText": "This time's theme is 『Spies』…… \nSo we'll be like agents or SPs. How about it?",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 193,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "う、うーん……パーティーか……",
                    "enText": "O-oh……A party, huh……",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 101,
                    "pathId": 3750340586637784449
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 6566883245917863301
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3915449482832631250,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "誘ってくれるのはありがたい。\n……でも、今日の華やかさを見る限り、どう考えても場違いだ。",
            "enText": "I was grateful for the invite. ……But, judging by today's \nfanfare, I would probably be well and truly out of place.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 102,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": 6319633826914846295
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 124,
                    "pathId": 2011113719736356564
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7864027659778097088,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女は、普段静かな自分とはあまりに違う世界で生きていた。\n……場慣れしていない自分が行って、迷惑をかけるのは避けたい。",
            "enText": "She lived in a completely different world from the \nquiet one I was used to. ……I wasn't really accustomed \nto it, so I didn't want to drag down the mood.",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 121,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……不慣れで迷惑かけそうだし、今回は――",
                    "enText": "……It probably won't be fun with me, so――",
                    "nextBlock": 29
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 45,
                    "pathId": 7736539552905822678
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 45,
                    "pathId": 115551243862181428
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 64,
                    "pathId": -1708322950663341120
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5614347892172429126,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "なるほど。\n……それなら、参加okayね！",
            "enText": "I see. \n……Then, you're coming! Okay!",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 159,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "え？",
                    "enText": "Eh?",
                    "nextBlock": 30
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": 4177975259101947528
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 62,
                    "pathId": -1299525455971767475
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1523538729597061206,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
